==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|en|thingumajig}}

===Etymology===
From {{m|en|thingum}} or {{compound|en|thingummy|jig}}, metrically patterned like {{m|en|gobbledygook}}, {{m|en|rigamarole}}.<ref>{{R:Dictionary.com}}</ref> Compare {{m|en|thingamabob}}, etc.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈθɪŋəməˌd͡ʒɪɡ/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|informal}} Something that one does not know the name of.
#: {{ux|en|He used this, this... this '''thingamajig''' you saw him with the other day to fix the problem.}}

====Synonyms====
* See [[Thesaurus:thingy]]

